  "config": {
    "names": ["Driver 1", "Driver 2", "Driver 3", "Driver 4"],
    "autoName": "Profile",
    "requireParked": true,
    "deleteArmSeconds": 10,
    "avatarMaxKB": 48,
    "comment": "names: the preset names Add and Rename offer (up to 10, owner-editable; non-ASCII works), plus '<autoName> N' with the first free N. requireParked: every write also needs the engine off and the gear in P (CDS rpm and VehicleInformation DataPowerTrain2) and no PIA job running; false skips that check (Guest-active and unprotected stay required for Copy). deleteArmSeconds: how long the second Delete press stays armed. avatarMaxKB: the largest own-picture file the app will send (1..512; 48 KB of jpg = 64 KiB of Base64). It is our guess, not a figure from the car: nobody has seen what persod accepts. Put the jpg files in <the app's data folder>/avatars/."
  }
